MISSION IMPAWSIBLE Campaign, ON NOW!=<p></p>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Accept this MISSION IMPAWSIBLE and help the Cats uncover a spy!'''}}<br>
An enemy infiltrator has broken a special Rare Capsule machine being built for The Battle Cats' 10th Anniversary party! It's now up to you to become an agent of the Cat Intelligence Agency and search for clues scattered throughout The Battle Cats app to help uncover the saboteur's true identity!

Discover clues during the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Clue Collection Phase (9/16 11:00AM - 10/7 11:00AM)'''}} and share your findings with your fellow agents!

Then, purchase a special Rare Ticket pack to accuse one of the suspects during the {{Color|#B96AD9|'''Accusation Phase (10/7 11:00AM - 10/14 11:00AM)'''}}!

Detailed info about the campaign can be found by tapping the button at the top right of the Cat Base menu.
|-|
MISSION IMPAWSIBLE Accusation Phase ON NOW!=<p></p>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''The accusation phase of the MISSION IMPAWSIBLE Campaign is ON NOW!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from October 7 (11:00AM) until October 14 (10:59AM)!'''}}

Tap the ACCUSATIONS button in the top-right of the Cat Base during the Accusation Phase and purchase the Rare Ticket for the character that you think committed the sabotage!

Players can expect the following rewards depending on their accusation:<br>
・5 Rare Tickets for a correct accusation<br>
・3 Rare Tickets for an incorrect accusation

After making an accusation, you can look up info on the accused from the MISSION IMPAWSIBLE button in the top-right of the Cat Base.

Check the information below and then make your accusation of who you think did it!

※If the ACCUSATIONS button does not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.<br>
※Please don't close the app until receiving confirmation of your purchase. Your accusation may not be properly recorded otherwise!<br>
※The only item provided by these sale packs is a Rare Ticket. Making this purchase does not provide you with the Cat Unit you have voted for.<br>
※Additional Rare Tickets earned from guessing a suspect will be distributed at a later date.<br>
※If you are under 18, please get an adult's permission before buying items with real money!
